<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:08:29 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>来认识一下诺亚·辛恩 (Noah Shinn)：这位 23 岁的大学辍学生，其病毒式人工智能助手正在成为马克·扎克伯格 Meta 的新挑战者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/noah-shinn-instinct-ai-assistant-meta-muse-alexandr-wang-tech-series-c-ai-agent-mark-zuckerberg/</link><description>本周，Instinct 在 C 轮融资中额外筹集了 10 亿美元，使公司估值达到 100 亿美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-29-at-171222-e1790716409611.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 07:04:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/noah-shinn-instinct-ai-assistant-meta-muse-alexandr-wang-tech-series-c-ai-agent-mark-zuckerberg/</guid></item><item><title>“经济越来越依赖人工智能收益”：人工智能技术“乐观情绪突然逆转”，美国 GDP 增长 2.2%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/us-gdp-2-2-reversal-optimism-ai-tech/</link><description>面对与伊朗的战斗及其造成的能源价格飙升，美国经济表现出惊人的弹性。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26273392157540-e1790783190708.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:06:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/us-gdp-2-2-reversal-optimism-ai-tech/</guid></item><item><title>福特汽车公司的吉姆·法利 (Jim Farley) 表示，Z 世代需要属于自己的“烟雾熊”时刻，以应对人工智能偏执、就业末日和技术行业的森林大火</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/gen-z-hiring-ai-paranoia-ford-ad-council-home-depot-wallace-dycom/</link><description>福特高管马克·特鲁比 (Mark Truby) 向《财富》杂志谈到他的 Z 世代儿子时表示：“他们有点偏执，认为人工智能可能会取代他们可能上学的工作。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2276970011-e1790720068497.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:45:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/gen-z-hiring-ai-paranoia-ford-ad-council-home-depot-wallace-dycom/</guid></item><item><title>Palo Alto Networks 的 Nikesh Arora 正在构建针对人工智能黑暗面的防御措施</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/nikesh-arora-palo-alto-networks-ceo-ai-cybersecurity-defense/</link><description>网络安全的人工智能清算已经到来，阿罗拉已成为首席执行官的首选顾问。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PAN-Nikesh_Arora-social-thumbnail.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/nikesh-arora-palo-alto-networks-ceo-ai-cybersecurity-defense/</guid></item><item><title>“十亿人死亡”：比尔·盖茨警告人工智能落入坏人之手，称终止开关和自我监管还不够</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/bill-gates-ai-dangers-bioweapons/</link><description>盖茨曾经是人工智能的乐观主义者之一，但现在他称之为“人类曾经接近过的最危险的事情” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2284795836-1-e1790782625484.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:38:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/bill-gates-ai-dangers-bioweapons/</guid></item><item><title>Carhartt 首席执行官警告学校正在引导 Z 世代学生远离利润丰厚的职业道路：技术行业的薪资可高出 32%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/carhartt-ceo-linda-hubbard-skilled-trades-shortage-six-figure-career-opportunities-for-gen-z-plumbers-electricans-technicans/</link><description>琳达·哈伯德 (Linda Hubbard) 表示，有兴趣获得六位数工作的学生并没有为成功做好准备，有一半的人开始接受培训后却从未完成。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2237973323-e1790779995578.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:28:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/carhartt-ceo-linda-hubbard-skilled-trades-shortage-six-figure-career-opportunities-for-gen-z-plumbers-electricans-technicans/</guid></item><item><title>LinkedIn 首席执行官表示，求职者发出的申请比大流行前多了 30%，而且“知道谁能真正胜任这份工作”变得更加困难</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/linkedin-ceo-dan-shapero-says-job-seekers-sending-out-30-more-applications-pre-pandemic-harder-know-who-can-do-job/</link><description>就业市场已经成为求职者和招聘人员之间全面的人工智能军备竞赛。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LinkedInCEO-e1790781668666.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:26:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/linkedin-ceo-dan-shapero-says-job-seekers-sending-out-30-more-applications-pre-pandemic-harder-know-who-can-do-job/</guid></item><item><title>耗资 160 亿美元的炼油厂将落户东非，日产量达 70 万桶</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/east-africa-16-billion-oil-refinery/</link><description>肯尼亚项目预计需要 40 个月的时间建设，因为该地区正在努力加工更多自己的原材料。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26273442493665.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:09:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/east-africa-16-billion-oil-refinery/</guid></item><item><title>“传奇之物”：私人收藏中梵高和塞尚未曾见过的作品即将以 4.5 亿美元的价格拍卖</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/vincent-van-gogh-private-collection-auction-450-million/</link><description>这些画作来自已故阿根廷艺术收藏家 Nelly Arrieta de Blaquier 和她的糖业大亨丈夫 Carlos Pedro Blaquier 的收藏，并由他们的孩子出售。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26273351867826-e1790780225981.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:08:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/vincent-van-gogh-private-collection-auction-450-million/</guid></item><item><title>威尔伯·罗斯表示，纽约的临时住所税针对的是“无法在投票箱进行报复”的人</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/wilbur-ross-new-york-pied-a-terre-tax-discriminates-people-cant-vote/</link><description>这位前商务部长和史蒂夫·韦恩 (Steve Wynn) 正在起诉州政府，指控他们在曼哈顿的住宅每年缴纳 83,531 美元和 183,094 美元的账单。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2174024704-e1790716983627.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:53:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/wilbur-ross-new-york-pied-a-terre-tax-discriminates-people-cant-vote/</guid></item></channel></rss>